4c7e7295 (Dengnifer 2026-09-04 17:19:42 +0800 1175) 	On a coordinate of $V^{(j)}$ every summand $f_i$ with $i \neq j$ vanishes, by disjointness, so the sum agrees there with $f_j$; outside $V^{(j)}$ both sides vanish.
4c7e7295 (Dengnifer 2026-09-04 17:19:42 +0800 1176) \end{proof}
