4c7e7295 (Dengnifer 2026-09-04 17:19:42 +0800 1178) \begin{lemma}[Formalization support for the values of a supported CL function]\label{lem:cl-supported-vanishing}
4c7e7295 (Dengnifer 2026-09-04 17:19:42 +0800 1179) 	\lean{MIPStarRE.QPBT.CondLinearTerm.eval_eq_zero_of_not_mem}
